      "id": "p_20260224140000_qualityassurancebot",
      "title": "QualityAssuranceBot",
      "description": "Webapp for agent call quality assurance: upload an audio recording of a support/sales call, transcribe it, then compare the agent's performance against their assigned call script and produce a structured review document. Target flow: (1) Upload audio file (e.g. WAV, MP3, M4A); (2) Server-side transcoding/transcription (e.g. Whisper or similar) to get a transcript; (3) User provides or selects the call script for that agent/campaign; (4) System compares transcript to script (coverage of required points, adherence, missed items, extra or off-script content); (5) Generate a review document summarizing how the agent did with scores, highlights, and improvement notes. Enables QA leads to batch-review calls and keep agents aligned to scripts.",
      "status": "backlog",
      "priority": "high",
      "dueDate": "2026-05-01",
